  "published": "2026-10-16T07:04:01.853Z",
  "releaseNotes": "## v4.2.0 - first release on NuGet; works against the Holochain 0.7 OASIS hApp (0.7.0 and 0.7.1)\n\n- Simple key/value + object store: SaveDataAsync/LoadDataAsync, SaveObjectAsync/LoadObjectAsync<T>, one hApp entry per StoreId, created then updated by action hash.\n- Reuses the installed app (data survives restarts); errors reported through OnError, LastError and each result's Message; ShutdownAsync.\n- New HoloNETAPIHapp overloads; the old (hAppId, hAppPath, hAppRole) string overloads are obsolete because they could bind to the zome/function overloads.\n- Fully tested against real Holochain 0.7.0 and 0.7.1 conductors (1,758 + 9 live/fake-conductor tests on each), line coverage ~93%.\n- Requires NextGenSoftware.Logging / NextGenSoftware.WebSocket 2.0.4 (fixes below).\n\nFull changelog: https://github.com/holochain-open-dev/holochain-client-csharp/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md\n\n---\n\nInitial public release of HoloNET API.",
